🫦 Togetherly • v1.28.3

— New app icon: a drawn mascot instead of letters.
— A pair no longer disappears from one stray press: the confirmation names your partner and warns that the chat goes for both of you.
— Waiting for a partner can be called off with "No longer waiting", and the second-seat code stops working.
— Sheets and dialogs take the colours of your couple's theme.
— Rotating and zooming the canvas stays yours: your partner turns the sheet, nothing moves on your side.
— Maps in memories open again.
— The partner profile no longer comes up empty.
— The app bothers the server less: lists and avatars stopped reloading in circles.
— A paid Togetherly+ unlocks on sign-in even when the payment e-mail differs from the account one.
